        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Maze Infinite Puzzle</strong> is a cozy, endlessly replayable maze-puzzle you can slip into any time.<br>Each run generates a fresh labyrinth and follows a <strong>gentle, flowing difficulty curve</strong> no spikes, no stress. Prefer to start fresh? <strong>Reset the flow at any moment</strong> and begin again from a smaller maze.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no timers and no combat just smooth movement, soft neon, and a <strong>10-track relaxing soundtrack</strong> to keep you focused while you unwind and <strong>collect Steam Achievements</strong> along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001910/extras/c3f5be18471175ccc5ed7c53275373aa.poster.avif?t=1772008966\" width=940 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001910/extras/c3f5be18471175ccc5ed7c53275373aa.webm?t=1772008966\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001910/extras/c3f5be18471175ccc5ed7c53275373aa.mp4?t=1772008966\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How it plays</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find the portal.</strong> Read the maze, plan a route, and move with simple keyboard controls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless procedural mazes.</strong> New layouts every time, scaling up gradually for a natural sense of progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reset anytime.</strong> Instantly restart the size/complexity flow whenever you want a clean slate.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two clean viewpoints.</strong> Toggle between a clear <strong>Top-Down</strong> angle and a stylish <strong>2.5D</strong> tilt.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Helpful, optional hints.</strong> Tap a subtle breadcrumb trail when you want a nudge then turn it off and keep exploring.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing, readable visuals.</strong> Minimalist forms and calm neon color palettes that shift from level to level.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001910/extras/e5b8440c490dfaf557c60b014a250c07.poster.avif?t=1772008966\" width=940 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001910/extras/e5b8440c490dfaf557c60b014a250c07.webm?t=1772008966\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001910/extras/e5b8440c490dfaf557c60b014a250c07.mp4?t=1772008966\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Infinite, procedurally generated mazes</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flowing difficulty ramp</strong> you control (with <strong>reset anytime</strong>)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Top-Down + 2.5D</strong> camera toggle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Optional hint system</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10-track relaxing soundtrack</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam Achievements</strong> to earn as you play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single-player, offline</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Colorful, minimalist, stylized look</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No combat, no timers, no pressure</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you’ve got five minutes or an hour, <strong>Maze Infinite Puzzle</strong> is a calm place to breathe, focus, and enjoy the simple satisfaction of finding your way again and again.</p>",
